			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					various visual assets and promotional materials for Slotbound were created with the assistance of generative AI tools.<br />
All AI-generated content was reviewed, refined, and integrated by the developer to ensure consistency with the game's artistic direction and quality standards.				</i>
			</p>
